# One anchor client (Cloud Shadows' occlusion copy, the ReflectionsPrepass anchor) refreshed every 5 frames for 2000 frames:
# its anchor's epoch alone is rebuilt each time. Compare localMiB in CS-AB-memory.csv before and after (rebuild-leak.env: full rebuilds).
